CS 361 Project 2 - Nondeterministic Finite Automata

Authors:
- Trevor Fry
- Caleb Backer

Overview:
This project implements a nondeterministic finite automaton (NFA) in Java.
The required classes are in the `fa.nfa` package:
- `NFA.java`
- `NFAState.java`

The program is tested with the provided JUnit test file:
- `test/nfa/NFATest.java`
